By bringing together next-gen technology and the finest live data available, Genius Sports is enabling a new era of sports for fans worldwide, delivering experiences that are more immersive, interactive and personalised than ever before.  Learn more at geniussports.com.  

This is a unique opportunity for a highly motivated individual to learn and master the technical delivery of our world-leading sports analytics and officiating technology (SAOT). You will be trained and mentored by top-tier specialists, gaining the skills to operate in a high-stakes environment and contribute to the integrity of the game.

What You'll Do

• Training:&nbsp;You will be fully trained to learn and master the technical delivery of our world-leading SAOT, from system setup to live operation.

• Matchday Operations:&nbsp;Under the guidance of senior team members, you will assist in operating our technology during live matches, focusing on building confidence and consistency.

• Technical Knowledge:&nbsp;Develop a strong understanding of the Laws of the Game, successfully completing monthly knowledge tests to build your expertise.

• Operational Support:&nbsp;Utilize our Knowledge Management System to learn and apply standard operating procedures, ensuring all tasks are completed with precision.

Required Attributes &amp; Skills

• Passion for Sport:&nbsp;A genuine interest in the sport and a desire to contribute to its integrity and accuracy.

• Technical Aptitude:&nbsp;A quick learner with the ability to understand and operate complex software and hardware.

• Attention to Detail:&nbsp;Meticulous and focused, able to spot small but critical details in fast-paced situations.

• Team-Oriented:&nbsp;A collaborative mindset and a strong desire to learn from others and contribute to the team's success.

• Adaptable &amp; Resilient:&nbsp;You can remain calm and composed in high-pressure situations, with the flexibility to work irregular hours and travel as required.

What We Offer

• Unparalleled Training:&nbsp;You will receive direct, hands-on training from some of the best technical specialists in the industry.

• Clear Career Path:&nbsp;This role is the starting point for a rewarding career in sports technology, with a clear path for progression to senior specialist and leadership roles.

Purpose-Driven Work:&nbsp;You will have a direct impact on the accuracy and fairness of live sporting events watched by millions around the world.

We enjoy an ‘office-first’ culture and maximize opportunities to collaborate, connect and learn together. Our hybrid working models differ depending on your role and location.&nbsp;

